speechtext:
It is my duty at this time to bring to the attention of hon. members that the following questions will be debated this evening at eleven o'clock: The hon. member for Skeena (Mr. Howard) - Royal Canadian Mounted Police;

The hon. member for Lotbiniere-the R.C.M.P. and Mr. Gregoire;

The hon. member for Northwest Territories (Mr. Rheaume)-air transport policy.
We will now resume the business interrupted at five o'clock.
